        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#aaa;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">Create a free account, get an API key, and start generating toke code. The console includes a playground to test prompts, API key management, and usage tracking with token counts.</p>
        <ul style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#888;margin:0 0 1rem 1.2rem;line-height:1.8;">
          <li>Free tier: 1,000 tokens per 6 hours</li>
